{"path":"system-programming/ch3-exercises.md","subject":"system-programming","slug":"ch3-exercises","format":"md","meta":{"title":"第 3 章 習題","tags":["習題"],"order":3.5,"summary":"第三章習題參考解答：用 CPU0 組合語言計算 a=b*3+c-d、交換暫存器 R1 與 R2 的內容（暫存器暫存法與 XOR 法），以及計算 1 到 20 的偶數和，附逐步追蹤與預期結果"},"hash":"4d7f920c0b32","html":"<p>題目來源：<a href=\"/content/system-programming/_pdf/ch03%E7%BF%92%E9%A1%8C.pdf\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"_pdf/ch03習題.pdf\">第三章習題</a>。概念說明見 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#ch3-asm-map\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch3-assembly#ch3-asm-map\">第 3 章 CPU0 組合語言</a>。</p>\n<p>繳交規定：markdown 文件，命名「學號.zip」，內容包含程式碼、執行 Assembler 的結果、執行 Virtual Machine 的結果。以下解答是手算追蹤的參考，as0／vm0 的實際輸出要自己執行後截取（用法見 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#as0-vm0\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch3-assembly#as0-vm0\">as0 與 vm0</a>）。</p>\n<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-expression\" data-level=\"2\" data-title=\"計算 a = b*3 + c - d\"><h2 id=\"q-expression\">計算 a = b*3 + c - d</h2>\n<p>（3.1-1）寫出一個 CPU0 組合語言程式，計算 <code>a = b*3 + c - d</code>；自行設定 b、c、d 的數值，先載入數值後再開始運算。</p>\n<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-expression-solution\" data-level=\"3\" data-title=\"詳解\" data-fold=\"true\"><h3 id=\"q-expression-solution\">詳解</h3>\n<p>設 b = 5、c = 4、d = 2，預期 a = 5 × 3 + 4 − 2 = <strong>17</strong>（0x11）。</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   R2, b        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R2 = b = 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   R3, c        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R3 = c = 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   R4, d        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R4 = d = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R5, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">3</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R5 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MUL</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R2, R5   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = b * 3 = 15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    ADD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R3   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 15 + 4 = 19</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    SUB</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R4   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 19 - 2 = 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    ST   R1, a        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; a = 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">R8</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">, a        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R8 = a，方便在 vm0 確認</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">a</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  RESW</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">b</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">c</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">d</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 2</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>注意事項：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CPU0 的運算只在暫存器之間進行，常數 3 也要先用 <code>LDI</code> 放進暫存器，<code>MUL</code> 沒有立即值版本。</li>\n<li>也可以不用乘法：<code>ADD R1, R2, R2</code> 再 <code>ADD R1, R1, R2</code>（b + b + b）。</li>\n<li>vm0 結束時應看到 R1 = R8 = 0x00000011 = 17。見 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#arithmetic\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch3-assembly#arithmetic\">算術運算</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n</section></section><section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-swap\" data-level=\"2\" data-title=\"交換 R1 與 R2\"><h2 id=\"q-swap\">交換 R1 與 R2</h2>\n<p>（3.1-2）寫出一個 CPU0 組合語言 swap，將暫存器 R1 與 R2 的內容交換；先載入自行設定的數值，再執行交換。</p>\n<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-swap-solution\" data-level=\"3\" data-title=\"詳解\" data-fold=\"true\"><h3 id=\"q-swap-solution\">詳解</h3>\n<p><strong>方法一：借用第三個暫存器</strong>（R1 = 3、R2 = 8）</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R1, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">3</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R1 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R2, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">8</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R2 = 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MOV</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R3, R1       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R3 = 3（暫存 R1）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MOV</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R2       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MOV</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R3       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R2 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span></code></pre>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>步驟</th><th>R1</th><th>R2</th><th>R3</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>載入後</td><td>3</td><td>8</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td><code>MOV R3, R1</code></td><td>3</td><td>8</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><code>MOV R1, R2</code></td><td>8</td><td>8</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><code>MOV R2, R3</code></td><td>8</td><td>3</td><td>3</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><strong>方法二：XOR 交換</strong>，不需要額外暫存器：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R1, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R2, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    XOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 3 ^ 8 = 11</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    XOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R2 = 11 ^ 8 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    XOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 11 ^ 3 = 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>因為 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⊕</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>⊕</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\oplus y \\oplus y = x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span>。注意如果直接 <code>MOV R1, R2</code> 再 <code>MOV R2, R1</code>，R1 原本的值會先被蓋掉，兩個都變成 8。見 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch2-cpu0-arch#logic-exec\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch2-cpu0-arch#logic-exec\">邏輯指令的執行</a>。</p>\n</section></section><section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-even-sum\" data-level=\"2\" data-title=\"1 到 20 的偶數和\"><h2 id=\"q-even-sum\">1 到 20 的偶數和</h2>\n<p>（3.1-3）使用 CPU0 組合語言撰寫一個程式，計算 1 到 20 的偶數和。</p>\n<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-even-sum-solution\" data-level=\"3\" data-title=\"詳解\" data-fold=\"true\"><h3 id=\"q-even-sum-solution\">詳解</h3>\n<p>偶數和 = 2 + 4 + … + 20 = 2 × (1 + 2 + … + 10) = <strong>110</strong>（0x6E）。i 從 2 開始、每次加 2，就不必判斷奇偶：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R1, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">0</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R1 = sum = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R2, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">2</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R2 = i = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R3, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">20</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">       ; R3 = 上限 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R4, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">2</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R4 = 步長 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    CMP</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R3       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; 比較 i 與 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    JGT  EXIT         </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; i > 20 就結束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    ADD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; sum += i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    ADD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R2, R4   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; i += 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    JMP</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  FOR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">EXIT</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    ST   R1, sum      </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; sum = 110</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">R8</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">, sum      </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R8 = sum，方便在 vm0 確認</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">sum</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\"> WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 0</span></span></code></pre>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>圈數</th><th>i（R2）</th><th>sum（R1）</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>4</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>6</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>…</td><td>…</td><td>…</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>20</td><td>110</td></tr><tr><td>檢查</td><td>22 > 20</td><td>跳到 EXIT</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>注意事項：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用 <code>LDI</code> 直接設定初值，避免 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#uninitialized-variable\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch3-assembly#uninitialized-variable\">未初始化變數</a>的問題。</li>\n<li>另一種寫法是 i 從 1 跑到 20，用 <code>AND R5, R2, R9</code>（R9 = 1）取最低位元判斷奇偶，最低位元為 0 才累加；比較麻煩，但示範了位元運算。</li>\n<li>vm0 結束時應看到 R1 = R8 = 0x0000006E = 110。迴圈結構見 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#for-loop\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch3-assembly#for-loop\">for 迴圈</a>。</li>\n</ul></section></section>","sections":[{"id":"q-expression","level":2,"title":"計算 a = b*3 + c - d","fold":false,"html":"<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-expression\" data-level=\"2\" data-title=\"計算 a = b*3 + c - d\"><h2 id=\"q-expression\">計算 a = b*3 + c - d</h2>\n<p>（3.1-1）寫出一個 CPU0 組合語言程式，計算 <code>a = b*3 + c - d</code>；自行設定 b、c、d 的數值，先載入數值後再開始運算。</p>\n<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-expression-solution\" data-level=\"3\" data-title=\"詳解\" data-fold=\"true\"><h3 id=\"q-expression-solution\">詳解</h3>\n<p>設 b = 5、c = 4、d = 2，預期 a = 5 × 3 + 4 − 2 = <strong>17</strong>（0x11）。</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   R2, b        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R2 = b = 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   R3, c        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R3 = c = 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   R4, d        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R4 = d = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R5, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">3</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R5 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MUL</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R2, R5   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = b * 3 = 15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    ADD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R3   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 15 + 4 = 19</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    SUB</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R4   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 19 - 2 = 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    ST   R1, a        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; a = 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">R8</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">, a        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R8 = a，方便在 vm0 確認</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">a</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  RESW</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">b</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">c</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">d</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 2</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>注意事項：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CPU0 的運算只在暫存器之間進行，常數 3 也要先用 <code>LDI</code> 放進暫存器，<code>MUL</code> 沒有立即值版本。</li>\n<li>也可以不用乘法：<code>ADD R1, R2, R2</code> 再 <code>ADD R1, R1, R2</code>（b + b + b）。</li>\n<li>vm0 結束時應看到 R1 = R8 = 0x00000011 = 17。見 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#arithmetic\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch3-assembly#arithmetic\">算術運算</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n</section></section>","text":"（3.1-1）寫出一個 CPU0 組合語言程式，計算 a = b*3 + c - d；自行設定 b、c、d 的數值，先載入數值後再開始運算。","links":[],"children":["q-expression-solution"]},{"id":"q-expression-solution","level":3,"title":"詳解","fold":true,"html":"<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-expression-solution\" data-level=\"3\" data-title=\"詳解\" data-fold=\"true\"><h3 id=\"q-expression-solution\">詳解</h3>\n<p>設 b = 5、c = 4、d = 2，預期 a = 5 × 3 + 4 − 2 = <strong>17</strong>（0x11）。</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   R2, b        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R2 = b = 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   R3, c        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R3 = c = 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   R4, d        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R4 = d = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R5, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">3</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R5 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MUL</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R2, R5   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = b * 3 = 15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    ADD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R3   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 15 + 4 = 19</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    SUB</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R4   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 19 - 2 = 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    ST   R1, a        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; a = 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">R8</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">, a        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R8 = a，方便在 vm0 確認</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">a</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  RESW</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">b</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">c</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">d</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 2</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>注意事項：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CPU0 的運算只在暫存器之間進行，常數 3 也要先用 <code>LDI</code> 放進暫存器，<code>MUL</code> 沒有立即值版本。</li>\n<li>也可以不用乘法：<code>ADD R1, R2, R2</code> 再 <code>ADD R1, R1, R2</code>（b + b + b）。</li>\n<li>vm0 結束時應看到 R1 = R8 = 0x00000011 = 17。見 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#arithmetic\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch3-assembly#arithmetic\">算術運算</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n</section>","text":"設 b = 5、c = 4、d = 2，預期 a = 5 × 3 + 4 − 2 = 17（0x11）。\nLD R2, b ; R2 = b = 5\nLD R3, c ; R3 = c = 4\nLD R4, d ; R4 = d = 2\nLDI R5, 3 ; R5 = 3\nMUL R1, R2, R5 ; R1 = b * 3 = 15\nADD R1, R1, R3 ; R1 = 15 + 4 = 19\nSUB R1, R1, R4 ; R1 = 19 - 2 = 17\nST R1, a ; a = 17\nLD R8, a ; R8 = a，方便在 vm0 確認\nRET\na: RESW 1\nb: WORD 5\nc: WORD 4\nd: WORD 2\n注意事項：\nCPU0 的運算只在暫存器之間進行，常數 3 也要先用 LDI 放進暫存器，MUL 沒有立即值版本。\n也可以不用乘法：ADD R1, R2, R2 再 ADD R1, R1, R2（b + b + b）。\nvm0 結束時應看到 R1 = R8 = 0x00000011 = 17。見 算術運算。","links":[{"ref":"ch3-assembly#arithmetic","style":"quiet","target":{"kind":"page","page":"system-programming/ch3-assembly","id":"arithmetic","href":"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#arithmetic"}}],"children":[]},{"id":"q-swap","level":2,"title":"交換 R1 與 R2","fold":false,"html":"<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-swap\" data-level=\"2\" data-title=\"交換 R1 與 R2\"><h2 id=\"q-swap\">交換 R1 與 R2</h2>\n<p>（3.1-2）寫出一個 CPU0 組合語言 swap，將暫存器 R1 與 R2 的內容交換；先載入自行設定的數值，再執行交換。</p>\n<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-swap-solution\" data-level=\"3\" data-title=\"詳解\" data-fold=\"true\"><h3 id=\"q-swap-solution\">詳解</h3>\n<p><strong>方法一：借用第三個暫存器</strong>（R1 = 3、R2 = 8）</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R1, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">3</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R1 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R2, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">8</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R2 = 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MOV</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R3, R1       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R3 = 3（暫存 R1）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MOV</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R2       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MOV</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R3       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R2 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span></code></pre>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>步驟</th><th>R1</th><th>R2</th><th>R3</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>載入後</td><td>3</td><td>8</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td><code>MOV R3, R1</code></td><td>3</td><td>8</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><code>MOV R1, R2</code></td><td>8</td><td>8</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><code>MOV R2, R3</code></td><td>8</td><td>3</td><td>3</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><strong>方法二：XOR 交換</strong>，不需要額外暫存器：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R1, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R2, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    XOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 3 ^ 8 = 11</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    XOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R2 = 11 ^ 8 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    XOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 11 ^ 3 = 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>因為 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⊕</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>⊕</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\oplus y \\oplus y = x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span>。注意如果直接 <code>MOV R1, R2</code> 再 <code>MOV R2, R1</code>，R1 原本的值會先被蓋掉，兩個都變成 8。見 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch2-cpu0-arch#logic-exec\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch2-cpu0-arch#logic-exec\">邏輯指令的執行</a>。</p>\n</section></section>","text":"（3.1-2）寫出一個 CPU0 組合語言 swap，將暫存器 R1 與 R2 的內容交換；先載入自行設定的數值，再執行交換。","links":[],"children":["q-swap-solution"]},{"id":"q-swap-solution","level":3,"title":"詳解","fold":true,"html":"<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-swap-solution\" data-level=\"3\" data-title=\"詳解\" data-fold=\"true\"><h3 id=\"q-swap-solution\">詳解</h3>\n<p><strong>方法一：借用第三個暫存器</strong>（R1 = 3、R2 = 8）</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R1, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">3</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R1 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R2, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">8</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R2 = 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MOV</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R3, R1       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R3 = 3（暫存 R1）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MOV</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R2       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    MOV</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R3       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R2 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span></code></pre>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>步驟</th><th>R1</th><th>R2</th><th>R3</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>載入後</td><td>3</td><td>8</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td><code>MOV R3, R1</code></td><td>3</td><td>8</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><code>MOV R1, R2</code></td><td>8</td><td>8</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><code>MOV R2, R3</code></td><td>8</td><td>3</td><td>3</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><strong>方法二：XOR 交換</strong>，不需要額外暫存器：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R1, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R2, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    XOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 3 ^ 8 = 11</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    XOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R2 = 11 ^ 8 = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    XOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R1 = 11 ^ 3 = 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>因為 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⊕</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>⊕</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\oplus y \\oplus y = x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span>。注意如果直接 <code>MOV R1, R2</code> 再 <code>MOV R2, R1</code>，R1 原本的值會先被蓋掉，兩個都變成 8。見 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch2-cpu0-arch#logic-exec\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch2-cpu0-arch#logic-exec\">邏輯指令的執行</a>。</p>\n</section>","text":"方法一：借用第三個暫存器（R1 = 3、R2 = 8）\nLDI R1, 3 ; R1 = 3\nLDI R2, 8 ; R2 = 8\nMOV R3, R1 ; R3 = 3（暫存 R1）\nMOV R1, R2 ; R1 = 8\nMOV R2, R3 ; R2 = 3\nRET\n步驟 R1 R2 R3\n載入後 3 8 0\nMOV R3, R1 3 8 3\nMOV R1, R2 8 8 3\nMOV R2, R3 8 3 3\n方法二：XOR 交換，不需要額外暫存器：\nLDI R1, 3\nLDI R2, 8\nXOR R1, R1, R2 ; R1 = 3 ^ 8 = 11\nXOR R2, R1, R2 ; R2 = 11 ^ 8 = 3\nXOR R1, R1, R2 ; R1 = 11 ^ 3 = 8\nRET\n因為 x \\oplus y \\oplus y = x 。注意如果直接 MOV R1, R2 再 MOV R2, R1，R1 原本的值會先被蓋掉，兩個都變成 8。見 邏輯指令的執行。","links":[{"ref":"ch2-cpu0-arch#logic-exec","style":"quiet","target":{"kind":"page","page":"system-programming/ch2-cpu0-arch","id":"logic-exec","href":"/system-programming/ch2-cpu0-arch#logic-exec"}}],"children":[]},{"id":"q-even-sum","level":2,"title":"1 到 20 的偶數和","fold":false,"html":"<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-even-sum\" data-level=\"2\" data-title=\"1 到 20 的偶數和\"><h2 id=\"q-even-sum\">1 到 20 的偶數和</h2>\n<p>（3.1-3）使用 CPU0 組合語言撰寫一個程式，計算 1 到 20 的偶數和。</p>\n<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-even-sum-solution\" data-level=\"3\" data-title=\"詳解\" data-fold=\"true\"><h3 id=\"q-even-sum-solution\">詳解</h3>\n<p>偶數和 = 2 + 4 + … + 20 = 2 × (1 + 2 + … + 10) = <strong>110</strong>（0x6E）。i 從 2 開始、每次加 2，就不必判斷奇偶：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R1, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">0</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R1 = sum = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R2, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">2</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R2 = i = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R3, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">20</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">       ; R3 = 上限 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R4, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">2</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R4 = 步長 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    CMP</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R3       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; 比較 i 與 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    JGT  EXIT         </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; i > 20 就結束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    ADD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; sum += i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    ADD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R2, R4   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; i += 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    JMP</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  FOR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">EXIT</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    ST   R1, sum      </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; sum = 110</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">R8</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">, sum      </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R8 = sum，方便在 vm0 確認</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">sum</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\"> WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 0</span></span></code></pre>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>圈數</th><th>i（R2）</th><th>sum（R1）</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>4</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>6</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>…</td><td>…</td><td>…</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>20</td><td>110</td></tr><tr><td>檢查</td><td>22 > 20</td><td>跳到 EXIT</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>注意事項：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用 <code>LDI</code> 直接設定初值，避免 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#uninitialized-variable\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch3-assembly#uninitialized-variable\">未初始化變數</a>的問題。</li>\n<li>另一種寫法是 i 從 1 跑到 20，用 <code>AND R5, R2, R9</code>（R9 = 1）取最低位元判斷奇偶，最低位元為 0 才累加；比較麻煩，但示範了位元運算。</li>\n<li>vm0 結束時應看到 R1 = R8 = 0x0000006E = 110。迴圈結構見 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#for-loop\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch3-assembly#for-loop\">for 迴圈</a>。</li>\n</ul></section></section>","text":"（3.1-3）使用 CPU0 組合語言撰寫一個程式，計算 1 到 20 的偶數和。","links":[],"children":["q-even-sum-solution"]},{"id":"q-even-sum-solution","level":3,"title":"詳解","fold":true,"html":"<section class=\"zn-section\" data-id=\"q-even-sum-solution\" data-level=\"3\" data-title=\"詳解\" data-fold=\"true\"><h3 id=\"q-even-sum-solution\">詳解</h3>\n<p>偶數和 = 2 + 4 + … + 20 = 2 × (1 + 2 + … + 10) = <strong>110</strong>（0x6E）。i 從 2 開始、每次加 2，就不必判斷奇偶：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki zyninote\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-asm\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R1, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">0</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R1 = sum = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R2, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">2</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R2 = i = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R3, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">20</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">       ; R3 = 上限 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LDI  R4, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">2</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        ; R4 = 步長 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    CMP</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R3       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; 比較 i 與 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    JGT  EXIT         </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; i > 20 就結束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    ADD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R1, R1, R2   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; sum += i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    ADD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  R2, R2, R4   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; i += 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    JMP</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  FOR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">EXIT</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    ST   R1, sum      </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; sum = 110</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    LD   </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">R8</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">, sum      </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">; R8 = sum，方便在 vm0 確認</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    RET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">sum</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\"> WORD</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 0</span></span></code></pre>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>圈數</th><th>i（R2）</th><th>sum（R1）</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>4</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>6</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>…</td><td>…</td><td>…</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>20</td><td>110</td></tr><tr><td>檢查</td><td>22 > 20</td><td>跳到 EXIT</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>注意事項：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用 <code>LDI</code> 直接設定初值，避免 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#uninitialized-variable\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch3-assembly#uninitialized-variable\">未初始化變數</a>的問題。</li>\n<li>另一種寫法是 i 從 1 跑到 20，用 <code>AND R5, R2, R9</code>（R9 = 1）取最低位元判斷奇偶，最低位元為 0 才累加；比較麻煩，但示範了位元運算。</li>\n<li>vm0 結束時應看到 R1 = R8 = 0x0000006E = 110。迴圈結構見 <a href=\"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#for-loop\" data-zn-link=\"quiet\" class=\"zn-link\" data-zn-ref=\"ch3-assembly#for-loop\">for 迴圈</a>。</li>\n</ul></section>","text":"偶數和 = 2 + 4 + … + 20 = 2 × (1 + 2 + … + 10) = 110（0x6E）。i 從 2 開始、每次加 2，就不必判斷奇偶：\nLDI R1, 0 ; R1 = sum = 0\nLDI R2, 2 ; R2 = i = 2\nLDI R3, 20 ; R3 = 上限 20\nLDI R4, 2 ; R4 = 步長 2\nFOR:\nCMP R2, R3 ; 比較 i 與 20\nJGT EXIT ; i > 20 就結束\nADD R1, R1, R2 ; sum += i\nADD R2, R2, R4 ; i += 2\nJMP FOR\nEXIT:\nST R1, sum ; sum = 110\nLD R8, sum ; R8 = sum，方便在 vm0 確認\nRET\nsum: WORD 0\n圈數 i（R2） sum（R1）\n1 2 2\n2 4 6\n3 6 12\n… … …\n10 20 110\n檢查 22 > 20 跳到 EXIT\n注意事項：\n用 LDI 直接設定初值，避免 未初始化變數的問題。\n另一種寫法是 i 從 1 跑到 20，用 AND R5, R2, R9（R9 = 1）取最低位元判斷奇偶，最低位元為 0 才累加；比較麻煩，但示範了位元運算。\nvm0 結束時應看到 R1 = R8 = 0x0000006E = 110。迴圈結構見 for 迴圈。","links":[{"ref":"ch3-assembly#uninitialized-variable","style":"quiet","target":{"kind":"page","page":"system-programming/ch3-assembly","id":"uninitialized-variable","href":"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#uninitialized-variable"}},{"ref":"ch3-assembly#for-loop","style":"quiet","target":{"kind":"page","page":"system-programming/ch3-assembly","id":"for-loop","href":"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#for-loop"}}],"children":[]}],"toc":[{"id":"q-expression","level":2,"title":"計算 a = b*3 + c - d","fold":false,"children":[{"id":"q-expression-solution","level":3,"title":"詳解","fold":true,"children":[]}]},{"id":"q-swap","level":2,"title":"交換 R1 與 R2","fold":false,"children":[{"id":"q-swap-solution","level":3,"title":"詳解","fold":true,"children":[]}]},{"id":"q-even-sum","level":2,"title":"1 到 20 的偶數和","fold":false,"children":[{"id":"q-even-sum-solution","level":3,"title":"詳解","fold":true,"children":[]}]}],"links":[{"ref":"_pdf/ch03習題.pdf","style":"quiet","target":{"kind":"file","file":"system-programming/_pdf/ch03習題.pdf","href":"/content/system-programming/_pdf/ch03%E7%BF%92%E9%A1%8C.pdf"},"section":null},{"ref":"ch3-assembly#ch3-asm-map","style":"quiet","target":{"kind":"page","page":"system-programming/ch3-assembly","id":"ch3-asm-map","href":"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#ch3-asm-map"},"section":null},{"ref":"ch3-assembly#as0-vm0","style":"quiet","target":{"kind":"page","page":"system-programming/ch3-assembly","id":"as0-vm0","href":"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#as0-vm0"},"section":null},{"ref":"ch3-assembly#arithmetic","style":"quiet","target":{"kind":"page","page":"system-programming/ch3-assembly","id":"arithmetic","href":"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#arithmetic"},"section":"q-expression-solution"},{"ref":"ch2-cpu0-arch#logic-exec","style":"quiet","target":{"kind":"page","page":"system-programming/ch2-cpu0-arch","id":"logic-exec","href":"/system-programming/ch2-cpu0-arch#logic-exec"},"section":"q-swap-solution"},{"ref":"ch3-assembly#uninitialized-variable","style":"quiet","target":{"kind":"page","page":"system-programming/ch3-assembly","id":"uninitialized-variable","href":"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#uninitialized-variable"},"section":"q-even-sum-solution"},{"ref":"ch3-assembly#for-loop","style":"quiet","target":{"kind":"page","page":"system-programming/ch3-assembly","id":"for-loop","href":"/system-programming/ch3-assembly#for-loop"},"section":"q-even-sum-solution"}],"diagnostics":[],"url":"/system-programming/ch3-exercises","backlinks":[],"broken":[]}